{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1N1Z2FyLSUyODIwMjQtJTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"Sugar","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/tLmwLYiI7EpPbhgmdeivNGY0xw7.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hL8GNwTjFlvB3nyMuIYldLWWYb5.jpg","description":"John Sugar is a dashing private eye navigating the dark corners of sunny LA. Though he sees only the good in humanity, Sugar is haunted by a secret too dangerous to expose.\n\nRated TV-MA · Returning Series · First aired 4 Apr 2024 · Ireland, United States of America · Language: English\nStudio: Genre Films, Protokino, Chapel Place Productions · Network: Apple TV\n\nNot complete. On your server: S1 8/8 | S2 not on server\n\nOn your server — Audio: English (from file names)","releaseInfo":"2024","genres":["Drama","Mystery","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1N1Z2FyLSUyODIwMjQtJTI5Lw.1.1","title":"Olivia","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2024-04-04T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"After solving a case in Japan, private eye John Sugar returns to LA to help find a missing woman with ties to a Hollywood legend.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uqWAMIlH0Xm9TQc1qr36mHRhn73.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1N1Z2FyLSUyODIwMjQtJTI5Lw.1.2","title":"These People, These Places","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2024-04-04T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Sugar suspects Melanie's not telling the full story. Meanwhile, he and Ruby may not be the only ones looking into the mysterious body in Olivia's trunk.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r6F32A5Pf6x1bngWFfPystXJlot.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1N1Z2FyLSUyODIwMjQtJTI5Lw.1.3","title":"Shibuya Crossing","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2024-04-11T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Melanie and Sugar get caught in a dicey situation—and make a new